WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In a busy room, doing a task is not the same as
seeing everything around it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The gorilla was visible. Some observers counting
passes did not report seeing it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
An attention experiment cannot prove what
a commercial meditation audio will do.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 describes 12-minute audio sessions.
Convenience is not proven efficacy.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check the exact course, checkout, refunds
and a free 12-minute alternative.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources. Decide what matters.
Find what others miss. Final Vestige Studios.
